    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-16: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.88";
    dc:description "The finite universe, counts, and periodicity property provide unambiguous decision criteria. Modern computation can reproduce the exhaustive result, although careful symmetry reduction and verification make it more than a routine small analysis.";
