    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Re-enumerate all two-color von Neumann-neighborhood template sets using symmetry reduction, decide satisfiability, and search periodic fundamental domains. Reproducing the three stated counts confirms the claim; any mismatching rule or count refutes it.";
