    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "A full independent enumeration is computationally large.", "The meaning of “171 patterns” must match the source's symmetry conventions.";
